       macOS/Windows toolchains, bazel rule repos, ABI dumps, Virtualization
       (3.5G), heavy test/fuzz tooling. Names verified 1:1 against the real
       LOS 22.2 default.xml (98 entries). If a build error ever names a
       missing project, move that one line back into a <project>. -->
